{"audio": "1timothy-04.opus", "voice": "Davis", "duration_ms": 114400, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 1867, "text": "1 Timothy, Chapter Four."}, {"start_ms": 1867, "end_ms": 18933, "text": "Now the Spirit speaketh expressly, that in the latter times some shall depart from the faith, giving heed to seducing spirits, and doctrines of devils; Speaking lies in hypocrisy; having their conscience seared with a hot iron; Forbidding to marry, and commanding to abstain from meats,"}, {"start_ms": 18933, "end_ms": 24533, "text": "which God hath created to be received with thanksgiving of them which believe and know the truth."}, {"start_ms": 24533, "end_ms": 33733, "text": "For every creature of God is good, and nothing to be refused, if it be received with thanksgiving: For it is sanctified by the word of God and prayer."}, {"start_ms": 33733, "end_ms": 44400, "text": "If thou put the brethren in remembrance of these things, thou shalt be a good minister of Jesus Christ, nourished up in the words of faith and of good doctrine, whereunto thou hast attained."}, {"start_ms": 44400, "end_ms": 51067, "text": "But refuse profane and old wives' fables, and exercise thyself rather unto godliness."}, {"start_ms": 51067, "end_ms": 61067, "text": "For bodily exercise profiteth little: but godliness is profitable unto all things, having promise of the life that now is, and of that which is to come."}, {"start_ms": 61067, "end_ms": 64800, "text": "This is a faithful saying and worthy of all acceptation."}, {"start_ms": 64800, "end_ms": 73600, "text": "For therefore we both labour and suffer reproach, because we trust in the living God, who is the Saviour of all men, specially of those that believe."}, {"start_ms": 73600, "end_ms": 76133, "text": "These things command and teach."}, {"start_ms": 76133, "end_ms": 87600, "text": "Let no man despise thy youth; but be thou an example of the believers, in word, in conversation, in charity, in spirit, in faith, in purity."}, {"start_ms": 87600, "end_ms": 91067, "text": "Till I come, give attendance to reading, to exhortation, to doctrine."}, {"start_ms": 91067, "end_ms": 98667, "text": "Neglect not the gift that is in thee, which was given thee by prophecy, with the laying on of the hands of the presbytery."}, {"start_ms": 98667, "end_ms": 104400, "text": "Meditate upon these things; give thyself wholly to them; that thy profiting may appear to all."}, {"start_ms": 104400, "end_ms": 114400, "text": "Take heed unto thyself, and unto the doctrine; continue in them: for in doing this thou shalt both save thyself, and them that hear thee."}], "words": [{"t": "1", "s": 0, "e": 662, "si": 0}, {"t": "Timothy,", "s": 662, "e": 964, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 1064, "e": 1405, "si": 0}, {"t": "Four.", "s": 1445, "e": 1706, "si": 0}, {"t": "Now", "s": 2287, "e": 2447, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 2467, "e": 2547, "si": 1}, {"t": "Spirit", "s": 2607, "e": 2907, "si": 1}, {"t": "speaketh", "s": 2967, "e": 3287, "si": 1}, {"t": "expressly,", "s": 3308, "e": 3868, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 4328, "e": 4448, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 4488, "e": 4548, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4568, "e": 4668, "si": 1}, {"t": "latter", "s": 4708, "e": 4988, "si": 1}, {"t": "times", "s": 5048, "e": 5468, "si": 1}, {"t": "some", "s": 5508, "e": 5708, "si": 1}, {"t": "shall", "s": 5768, "e": 5928, "si": 1}, {"t": "depart", "s": 5968, "e": 6309, "si": 1}, {"t": "from", "s": 6349, "e": 6469, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 6509, "e": 6589, "si": 1}, {"t": "faith,", "s": 6649, "e": 6969, "si": 1}, {"t": "giving", "s": 7349, "e": 7629, "si": 1}, {"t": "heed", "s": 7689, "e": 7949, "si": 1}, {"t": "to", "s": 7989, "e": 8049, "si": 1}, {"t": "seducing", "s": 8149, "e": 8649, "si": 1}, {"t": "spirits,", "s": 8709, "e": 9130, "si": 1}, {"t": "and", "s": 9250, "e": 9350, "si": 1}, {"t": "doctrines", "s": 9370, "e": 9810, "si": 1}, {"t": "of", "s": 9830, "e": 9910, "si": 1}, {"t": "devils;", "s": 9970, "e": 10410, "si": 1}, {"t": "Speakin